        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana KR114, Solid Brass Half Round Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful classic shaped half round cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. It brings a touch of classical hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece or drawer. Its solid brass construction will look great even after years of use. Available in 10 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-KR114-Specifications.gif?v=1704354675\" width=\"332\" height=\"159\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana KCKR11424 Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese cabinet knobs can be combined with either the <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc100\"><b>1\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-cabinet-knob-1-1-2-inch-decorative-base-plate-deltana-bprc150\"><b>1-1/2\" Decorative Base Plate</b></a> for that extra decorative level. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana KR114 Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter at Base: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KR114.pdf?v=1691095384\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana KR114 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Half Round Cabinet Knob | Deltana KR114",
                "description": "Half Round Cabinet Knob Deltana KR114 - This beautiful classic shaped half round cabinet knob is decorative as well as functional. Each cabinet knob includes a screw for easy installation. It brings a touch of classical hardware decor to any desk, cabinet door, furniture piece or drawer. Its solid brass construction will look great even after years of use. Available in 10 finishes.\r\n",
